* Retain feasible large-SD group-mixture witnesses in private likelihood audits,
  distinguishing selected zero-SD candidates from models with SD fixed at zero.

* Add a guarded prepared-group large-SD likelihood limit adapter that retains
  fixed references, normalized endpoint densities, and existing fitting gates.

* Check large-SD weighted-SQ conditional probabilities and quantiles against
  independent native integrals while preserving uncertainty distinctions.

* Check exact zero-SD weighted-SQ likelihood faces, their remaining derivatives,
